  "## A scholar’s own copy",
  "This is Saint Augustine’s great book On the Trinity, copied at Llanbadarn Fawr by Ieuan ap Sulien, the son of Bishop Sulien and the artist of the Rhygyfarch Psalter.[[cite:parker-199]] It is a large book of fine parchment, 36 lines to a page, in Ieuan’s round and steady hand, with decorated letters at the start of each book.",
  "## Ieuan’s poem",
